"P1403159786" "Be on the lookout: the {VillainGroup} members have robbed an estate sale and escaped with {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3695604271" "Members of the {VillainGroup} are wanted for illegal trafficking in mystic artifacts."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2267110986" "A police detective has traced the theft of {ITEM_NAME} back to the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P283166070" "All units advised to continue searching for the {VillainGroup} in possession of {ITEM_NAME} before their deadline ends."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1177680103" "Be on the alert: the {VillainGroup} is threatening to destroy {ITEM_NAME} unless the ransom is paid."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3777003035" "According to the police band, the {VillainGroup} are attempting to ransom {ITEM_NAME} back to the rightful owners, and the police negotiator isn't making any headway."
