// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3186588237" "You'd heard rumors that members of the {VillainGroup} had been seen casing the location where {ITEM_NAME} was being kept. Time to pay them a visit."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P184787917" "From the police band chatter, it sounds like members of the {VillainGroup} staged a daring raid on the Museum of Antiquities in Croatoa. They got away with the {ITEM_NAME}, and that could be trouble."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1529912124" "The {VillainGroup} got away with {ITEM_NAME}! That could be bad, if they know what to do with it. You'd heard a rumor that they'd set up a hide-out to use after an upcoming job, and this might be it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4209063910" "You knew that auction was a dangerous idea when you heard about it, but getting proven right isn't always a good thing. The PPD have their hands full. This might be a good task to handle yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3488330959" "You have to wonder how something like {ITEM_NAME} could have ended up at an estate sale, but that's Paragon City for you. The important thing is to get it away from the bad guys."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1145312190" "It all makes sense now. You'd heard a rumor that someone was trying to smuggle {ITEM_NAME} into the city. It must be the {VillainGroup}! Now all you have to do is catch them!"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4056117371" "It would be a shame to let all of that detective work go to waste. It would be even worse if the {VillainGroup} got away with stealing {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2553797340" "You'd heard that the {VillainGroup} had issued a threat, claiming that they could use {ITEM_NAME} in some way to bring ruin to the city. You're not sure this is a real threat, but it might be worth taking care of."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2757948036" "{ITEM_NAME} is a valuable relic. You can't let the {VillainGroup} destroy it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3747207884" "You heard about this situation the other day. The Police have their hands tied, but maybe if you intervened, you cut wrap this one up and keep the {VillainGroup} from profiting by this scheme."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3900886557" "According to the occultist, before he escaped he learned that the {VillainGroup} had a plan of some kind involving the {ITEM_NAME}. Someone should put a stop to that."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3906689496" "You have to wonder how anyone could lose {ITEM_NAME} on a train, but that does match the rumor that members of the {VillainGroup} were claiming to have it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3433962633" "From the detective's report it sounds like the bad guys got away with the {ITEM_NAME}, but you might know where they are."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1045879403" "A crook working for the {VillainGroup} stole {ITEM_NAME} from a private collector. You don't know what {VillainGroup} wants the artifact for, but it can't be for anything good."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3705969653" "MAGI has had a lot of bad luck keeping mystic items out of evil hands. It would be good a good idea to help them on this one."

