// Variable Group - depends_on_Item Var Name - ITEM_DESCRIPTION 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1578406081" "The old leather-bound book contains numerous spells and incantations, but nothing that makes sense. Maybe it's time hasn't come yet."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2108424229" "This old crown supposedly came from an old cult in the Rogue Isles. Whatever strange energies it possesses, it's important that you get it out of the bad guy's hands."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3180491648" "This tiny sliver of crystal must be it. It's a small shard of one of he Crystals of Serafina, magic gems owned by the famous genie. You can feel it pulsing with a warm and friendly eldritch energy, almost like it's happy you rescued it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P840204802" "Dr. Don Gee was a famous mystic of the 1600s who supposedly died during a mysterious sea voyage. These notes, written in cipher, supposedly detail the mystic rituals he used to secure his fortunes at the cost of others."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P372004563" "'Baron' Zoria was already a notorious occult villain around the turn of the century when he began to investigate the legends of the Lost City of Oranbega. Whatever he found, he re-emerged at the head of a new cult known as the Circle of Thorns. Some say whatever dire secrets he found changed him forever. He used to use wands like this all the time in his occult crimes, and many seek his old cast-offs to improve their own powers."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3594452209" "Mot was the Carthaginian god of death and sterility, before the city of Carthage was destroyed by ancient Rome. For some reason, mystically oriented villains seem attracted to Mot's few remaining artifacts."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3460824872" "It's said that once every hundred years the genie Serafina casts her old veil aside to find a new one. Many unscrupulous sorcerers would do anything to get their hands on it in the hope they could use it against the benevolent genie."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4226720458" "The Blue Oyster is a giant sapphire. Rumors say it can be used to summon a giant monster from the depths, or contact elder beings called 'The Invisible Ones'. Whatever it's supposed to do, it's best that the bad guys don't have it anymore."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3864535466" "This strange gem seems to reflect back the eyes of everyone who's ever looked into it. It's said that a properly trained mystic could use it to see what all of those other eyes have seen."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P18446616" "This painting is done completely in gold leaf, and supposedly shows an island in the ocean that once had a portal to another world."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1589809442" "This scroll was penned by those who believe that life here began 'out there', in the depths of space. It talks about the lost colonies of humanity that are supposed to live among the stars."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4029642855" "This isn't so much a hand, as a big elaborately decorated box. The thing doesn't seem to respond to anything, like it's just waiting for it's true owner to return."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P298728243" "It's said this man-shaped root screams when torn from the earth. This one was already been picked, so it's not so bad."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1198084724" "This is disgusting. It looks like some kind of naked pygmy with blue skin and green hair and eyes and smells like rotten eggs. You're pretty sure it's culturally relevant somehow, to someone."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2609780941" "The cultural and historical importance of these silver coins recovered from the bottom of the sea far outweigh their monetary value. But some would say that their magical value is greater still."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1481771890" "It's an odd crystal with a thin violet line running through the middle. You have no idea how to read it, but there's a large 'spike', like on a heart monitor, a few millimeters to the right. Does that mean some major event is coming soon?"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4264010705" "This is supposed to the holy text of an alien religion from the future, but no one's been able to decipher it. Legends say no one will be able to interpret it properly until the year 2260."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1333902311" "Legends say that if you find all 7 of the Dragoon Balls, it will summon a might mystical cavalryman who can grant you a wish. But this is only one of them, so it's really not that useful."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3585028381" "These strange marked rocks come from India. They glow with a warm light when you bring them close together."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1105579037" "Hmm. It's red and it's a ruby and it makes you feel weak when you hold it. This is definitely one for MAGI. Heck, maybe it's a good thing if a villain steals this from the vault!"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2239815557" "It's a painting of Lee Towers in Paragon City, but it seems alive. Clouds move, people walk about, heroes fly by, and even the time changes. Rumor is you can use the painting to get inside, but no one knows how to do it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2275682930" "This ancient staff doesn't seem to have any real mystic power, but you never can tell with these things. Best to get it out of evil's hands and to the proper authorities."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2870231656" "This vicious looking mummified claw looks like it came from a demon or worse. Legends say that you need a truly wicked heart to use it, so it's a good thing that you recovered it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2340426112" "Wow. That is one big claw. You'd hate to imagine the bird this sucker came from."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1686332090" "Urns, pots, and a couple of bronze weapons. While they don't have much overt mystical power, a properly trained and prepared wizard could use them for some very dangerous purposes."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3914826908" "The blade feels heavy in your hand. Visions of demons and ancient ziggurats dance in your mind. You feel a dark and malevolent presence creeping into your mind, urging you to put the blade to your throat. You have to fight with all of your will just to put the thing down, but the images won't fade until this is sealed away."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P580924252" "This strange dagger has been sought for years by Nepalese monks, who want it returned as a holy artifact. It's supposed to have the power to slay demons, when wielded by the right person."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2273689645" "The city isn't safe with {ITEM_NAME} in evil hands."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2613901526" "The {VillainGroup} will soon learn that crime doesn't pay in Paragon City."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3368437505" "With {ITEM_NAME} missing and the {VillainGroup} to blame, it's a good thing you're on the job."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P972593881" "It's up to you to stop the {VillainGroup}'s thieving ways."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P868178641" "You're the only one who can get the {ITEM_NAME} away from the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3861247942" "The PPD won't be able to handle this. It's up to you to get the {ITEM_NAME} from the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3987540446" "A lot of cops could get hurt if they try to get {ITEM_NAME} from the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P4282684760" "A treasure like {ITEM_NAME} shouldn't be in the hands of thieves like the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2480399285" "Whatever the {VillainGroup} wants with {ITEM_NAME}, it can't be good."
